  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Systems Development approach training sessions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacity Africa CAFOD staff and partners in the Market Systems Development approach. The training will take place in four venues (Freetown, Nairobi, Harare, Goma).
The objectives of the consultancy are
- to facilitate a one-day online introductory session on MSD with CAFOD management aimed at providing an overview of content of MSD, main challenges and management and team implications
- to train partners &amp; CAFOD staff in 4 countries on MSD to equip them with an understanding of the approach and its applications
- to undertake a thorough market assessment research &amp; analysis in Sierra Leone/Liberia, Kenya, Zimbabwe &amp; DRC as flagship MSD work, and support in co-creation of intervention strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
